        "goal_understanding": "The goal was to navigate each grid level and complete all goal cells. A goal cell only completes when my carried piece simultaneously matches that goal\u2019s required shape, color, and rotation, and then I step onto the activated goal. Completing all goals advances to the next level; finishing all levels wins.",
